From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWrt Builder
Date: Sat, 2 Aug 2026 15:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: mediatek: expose AIROHA_CPU_PM_DOMAIN for
 ARCH_AIROHA

The AIROHA_CPU_PM_DOMAIN config option is placed inside the
"MediaTek PM Domains" menu which depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST.
Airoha SoCs use ARCH_AIROHA, not ARCH_MEDIATEK, so the menu is hidden
and AIROHA_CPU_PM_DOMAIN is silently dropped even when set in target
config.

Add ARCH_AIROHA to the menu dependency so the option is visible.

Signed-off-by: OpenWrt Builder
---
 drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/Kconfig
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 menu "MediaTek PM Domains"
-	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || ARCH_AIROHA || COMPILE_TEST
 
 config MTK_SCPSYS
 	bool "MediaTek SCPSYS Support"
